  "comment": "Curated catalogue of community + first-party apps + themes installable into Morpheus. Each entry has a `type` of either 'plugin' or 'theme'. Plugins extend admin/storefront behaviour; themes own the storefront presentation. Both are listed under the same /dashboard/apps/store/ surface so the merchant has one place to extend the platform. Future iterations move to a remote registry served by an off-Morpheus index.",
  "apps": [
